#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/t-c-business-services-components-benefits-package-registry-distinguishing-the-benefits-pack-c66f4f.md:5
msgid "Authoritative benefit package definitions and testable machine-readable reference rules: covered services, procedures, medicines, devices, exclusions, co-payment parameters, utilisation caps, annual limits, general eligibility criteria, payer attribution, plain-language summaries, and facility-tier linkages."
msgstr ""

#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/t-c-business-services-components-benefits-package-registry-ad83df.md:4
msgid "Authoritative package definitions anchoring operational enrolment, eligibility, contracting, and claims processes; reduced duplication with other payers."
