#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/t-c-business-services-components-benefits-package-registry-d6c531.md:5
msgid "Benefit structure definition. The Benefits Package Registry shall support the structured definition and publication of what each package covers, including services, procedures, diagnostics, medicines, devices, exclusions, co-payment and cost-sharing parameters, utilisation caps, annual benefit limits, and general conditions under which covered items may be accessed, as authoritative reference content consumed by operational contracting and claims systems."
