#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/t-c-metadata-registries-and-foundati-terminology-service-817b54.md:20
msgid "Code translation using concept maps. The TS shall support the translation of codes from one code system to another using published concept maps, returning the target code, the equivalence relationship, and relevant context for the translation. (TSF-13; TSWF-8 Translate Code — Required)"
msgstr ""

#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/t-c-metadata-registries-and-foundati-terminology-service-817b54.md:17
msgid "Code validation. The TS shall validate codes submitted by consuming systems, confirming whether a given code exists in a specified code system or value set and returning the validation result with relevant concept details. Consuming systems should be able to specify the code system version for version-specific validation. (TSF-12; TSWF-1 Verify Code Existence; TSWF-2 Verify Code Membership — Required)"
