#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/t-c-metadata-registries-and-foundati-terminology-service-817b54.md:15
msgid "Concept map export. The TS shall support the export of concept maps in formats ranging from a structured source-target code list to a FHIR ConceptMap resource in XML or JSON. (TSF-10 — Required)"
