msgid "Data quality assurance. Built-in validation rules, completeness checks, consistency checks, and outlier detection that flag and support the resolution of data quality issues at the point of entry and during aggregation, with structured feedback to contributing facilities and programmes so that issues identified centrally can be resolved at source."
