#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/p-c-metadata-registries-and-foundati-terminology-service-82a9f9.md:2
msgid "Digital systems no longer need to maintain their own local copies of code systems and value sets, reducing duplicated effort and the risk of divergence that undermines data comparability over time."
