#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/t-c-business-services-components-benefits-package-registry-distinguishing-the-benefits-pack-c66f4f.md:6
msgid "Directly links scheme-specific enrolment records to the canonical Client Registry identifier. Holds person-level scheme membership, contribution, and exemption attributes that must not be stored in the Client Registry itself, while reconciling against the Client Registry to support cross-scheme duplicate-enrolment checks."
msgstr ""

