#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/p-c-metadata-registries-and-foundati-logical-information-model-reposi-085ded.md:6
msgid "Discovery and search. A publicly accessible interface enabling implementers, clinicians, and policymakers to find, browse, and understand existing models before building or procuring systems, reducing duplicated modelling effort and enabling reuse of nationally governed definitions."
msgstr ""

#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/t-c-metadata-registries-and-foundati-logical-information-model-reposi-257cac.md:13
msgid "Discovery and search. The LIMR shall expose publicly accessible search and browsing capabilities that allow users and consuming systems to locate models, data elements, and definitions by name, domain, version, status, or associated standard, enabling reuse of nationally governed definitions and reducing duplicated modelling effort."
msgstr ""

