#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/t-c-metadata-registries-and-foundati-health-facility-registry-ecfb41.md:4
msgid "Facility record creation and maintenance. The Health Facility Registry shall support the creation, update, and maintenance of authoritative identity records for all health facilities, capturing the minimum dataset defined in Section 6 and assigning a unique, persistent, nationally assigned facility identifier at registration. (Extends FRF-3)"
msgstr ""

