msgid "Facility status and service change management. Management of facility operational status changes (opening, closure, temporary closure, service additions or removals) with effective dates, enabling consuming systems to reflect current service availability and enabling retrospective analysis of service history."
msgstr ""

#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/t-c-metadata-registries-and-foundati-health-facility-registry-ecfb41.md:7
msgid "Facility status and service change management. The Health Facility Registry shall support the curation of facility operational status changes — openings, closures, temporary closures, and changes to services offered — with effective dates, enabling consuming systems to reflect current service availability and enabling retrospective analysis of service history. (FRF-12)"
msgstr ""

#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/p-c-business-services-components-benefits-package-registry-2f494f.md:5
msgid "Facility tier and provider category linkage. Support for associating benefit packages with the general facility types, care levels, service categories, and practitioner qualification types through which covered services may be accessed (referencing the Health Facility Registry and Health Workforce Registry), while keeping provider-specific empanelment, contracting, and service authorisation in operational Contract and Benefits Management Systems."
msgstr ""

#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/t-c-business-services-components-benefits-package-registry-d6c531.md:9
msgid "Facility tier and provider category linkage. The Benefits Package Registry shall support the association of benefit packages with the general facility types, care tiers, service levels, and practitioner qualification categories through which covered services may be accessed (referencing the Health Facility Registry and Health Workforce Registry), while keeping provider-specific empanelment, payer-provider contracts, and payment eligibility in operational Contract and Benefits Management Systems."
msgstr ""

