#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/t-c-business-services-components-computable-decision-support-engi-4b7f45.md:30
msgid "Fail-safe behaviour. The CDSE shall be designed to fail safely: in the event of a failure to retrieve patient context, evaluate a rule, or deliver an output, the consuming system shall be informed of the failure and proceed with clinical care without being blocked, and the failure shall be logged for investigation."
msgstr ""

