#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/p-c-business-services-components-benefits-package-registry-3ff245.md:4
msgid "For beneficiaries, this transparency means that what they are entitled to is discoverable, checkable, and comparable to what they actually receive — a foundational condition for accountability in health financing, provided that machine-readable definitions are accompanied by plain-language, multilingual, accessible explanations and assisted-access support for patients and communities."
