#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/p-e-5534a6.md:1
msgid "Goal: a health system that ensures the right number and skill mix of trained health and care personnel with the right skills are in the right place at the right time to meet population health needs, and a health workforce whose members — across both regulated professions and non-licensed or community cadres — are individually identifiable and verifiable (Sub-goal 2.1), equitably deployed and retained where they are needed (Sub-goal 2.2), paid reliably and on time in compliance with labour rights (Sub-goal 2.3), supported to maintain and extend their competencies across the course of their careers (Sub-goal 2.4), and backed by trustworthy registration and authorisation status that safeguards patient safety, public accountability, and worker privacy (Sub-goal 2.5)."
msgstr ""

#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/p-e-083161.md:1
msgid "Goal: anticipate epidemic and climate-related health threats early enough to act, and mount a coordinated response when they arrive."
msgstr ""

#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/p-e-3d3f79.md:1
msgid "Goal: care that is informed by a person's full health history, guided by current evidence at the point of care, and coordinated across every provider, setting, and episode a person moves through."
msgstr ""

#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/p-e-40301a.md:1
msgid "Goal: core health data is captured once and reused reliably across programmes, services, and levels of care."
msgstr ""

#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/p-e-405b00.md:1
msgid "Goal: every person has a verifiable digital health record that they can access and control, and that authorised providers can rely on across the places they seek care."
msgstr ""

#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/p-e-deab37.md:1
msgid "Goal: mobilise, pool, and allocate health funds efficiently and equitably, purchase covered services transparently, pay providers and health workers reliably, and protect people from financial hardship when they seek care."
msgstr ""

#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/p-e-0e6ccd.md:1
msgid "Goal: safe health products reach the people who need them, when and where they are needed, through a supply chain that is visible end to end and able to adapt when demand shifts."
msgstr ""

