#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/p-c-business-services-components-computable-decision-support-engi-2a67bd.md:5
msgid "Operationalising WHO SMART Guidelines and national clinical pathways, providing the runtime infrastructure through which computable representations of clinical guidelines are deployed into digital health systems and executed at the point of care, bridging the gap between guideline development and consistent guideline application at scale"
msgstr ""

#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/t-b-f241d4.md:7
msgid "Optimise supply chain management"
msgstr ""

