#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/p-f-be46bc.md:6
msgid "Proportionate public consultation. Rather than leaving external consultation absent or purely optional, SGI governance should require proportionate public consultation for high-impact national artefacts (such as core national data models, mandated code systems and extensions, cross-programme value sets, and national implementation guides), providing accessible consultation materials (including plain-language summaries alongside technical artefacts), defined review windows, publication of submitted responses, and a transparent explanation of disposition for how comments were accepted, modified, or declined."
