msgid "Reference data support for eligibility inquiries. The Benefits Package Registry shall provide the structured benefit definitions and testable coverage rule artefacts required by operational eligibility services to answer provider-initiated and beneficiary-initiated eligibility inquiries, while person-specific enrolment lookup and runtime eligibility determination remain in the Beneficiary Registry, CBMS, or a separate governed rules service."
