#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/p-e-deab37.md:12
msgid "Registry linkage versus comprehensive fraud and integrity governance. Linking claims and enrolment records to authoritative Client, Facility, Workforce, Product, Supplier, and Benefits Package registries supports integrity controls and helps detect duplicate enrolment or phantom entities, but registry linkage does not by itself prevent fraud, corruption, false claims, upcoding, collusion, or leakage. Safeguarding health funds requires combining registry verification with operational clinical and financial audit, anomaly detection, investigation workflows, graduated sanctions, beneficiary and provider appeal mechanisms, internal financial controls, and independent oversight."
msgstr ""

