#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/p-d-3-who-smart-guidelines-pilot-imple-e64fad.md:1
msgid "Several countries — including Ethiopia, the Philippines and Uganda — have piloted the deployment of L3 computable decision logic for areas such as antenatal care, HIV and immunisation within national health information systems. These pilots provide early evidence that internationally developed computable guidelines can be operationalised nationally, reducing the time and cost of adapting international clinical guidance for national deployment."
