msgstr ""

#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/p-d-2-spain-1f3e8b.md:1
msgid "Spain implements a federated national record (Historia Clínica Digital del SNS) that shares key clinical documents across seventeen autonomous communities through a national interoperability node, without centralising clinical data \\cite{es-ministerio-sanidad}. A federated national health information system aggregates indicators from the same devolved structure, and a national repository of logical information models (SOMSNS) maintains shared definitions \\cite{somsns}. Spain demonstrates how a national interoperability framework can enable cross-jurisdictional exchange while preserving regional autonomy over data governance."
msgstr ""

