msgid "Specialisation"
msgstr ""

#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/t-c-metadata-registries-and-foundati-product-registry-2e4f9b.md:6
msgid "Stable. Core identity attributes change infrequently — typically on product launch, regulatory reclassification, packaging revision, or manufacturer change. The registry is designed for master data that is authoritative and slow-moving."
msgstr ""

