#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/p-c-business-services-components-computable-decision-support-engi-2a67bd.md:6
msgid "Supporting medication safety through systematic checking of drug interactions, allergy contraindications, dosage ranges, and duplicate therapies at the point of prescribing, reducing the risk of preventable adverse drug events."
