#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/p-d-2-tanzania-93bef4.md:1
msgid "Tanzania operates one of the more mature national health management information systems on the African continent, consolidating routine facility reporting across all levels with programme data from areas such as HIV, malaria, immunisation, and maternal and child health. It demonstrates how a large, geographically diverse country can consolidate multiple programme data streams into a coherent national information system, and offers lessons on data-quality governance, subnational capacity building and the management of facility reporting burden."
msgstr ""

#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/p-f-be46bc.md:4
msgid "Technical and implementability review. Technical review must extend beyond syntactic or schema correctness to evaluate end-to-end implementability and validation, covering formal structural and profile validation, cross-artefact dependency and version-pinning checks, terminology binding and value-set expansion resolution, runtime performance and scalability impact, security and access-control considerations, backwards compatibility and data-migration pathways, validated implementation examples, and conformance-test readiness (including executable test fixtures and assertions)."
msgstr ""

#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/p-f-46b1ae.md:9
msgid "Technical modeller (model authority / technical steward): designs and maintains logical information models, structural profiles, terminology bindings, and computable constraints in the LIMR."
