#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/t-c-business-services-components-public-health-surveillance-platf-181696.md:27
msgid "Terminology alignment for case definitions. The PHSP shall use coded disease identifiers, pathogen classifications, clinical findings, and surveillance indicators governed by the Terminology Service, and shall subscribe to update notifications from the Terminology Service to ensure surveillance case definitions and reporting forms remain aligned with current terminology versions as international standards evolve."
msgstr ""

