#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/p-c-business-services-components-computable-decision-support-engi-97cc2b.md:5
msgid "Terminology and information model alignment. Resolution of clinical concepts referenced in decision logic against the Terminology Service, and validation of input data against logical information models published in the LIMR, ensuring that decision logic operates on consistently coded and structured data regardless of the source system that contributed it and that recommendations are based on correctly interpreted clinical information."
