#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/t-c-metadata-registries-and-foundati-client-registry-a1d132.md:30
msgid "Transaction monitoring. The Client Registry shall support the tracking and monitoring of inbound and outbound identity transactions, recording the source, destination, timestamp, and outcome of each transaction to support operational oversight and troubleshooting. (OpenHIE CRF-3)"
