#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/p-c-business-services-components-computable-decision-support-engi-97cc2b.md:11
msgid "Transparency and explainability. Provision, alongside each recommendation, of a human-readable explanation of the reasoning applied — including the rules evaluated, the data inputs considered, and the evidence or guideline source referenced — enabling clinicians to understand, evaluate, and exercise informed judgement about the guidance they receive."
msgstr ""

#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/t-c-business-services-components-computable-decision-support-engi-4b7f45.md:25
msgid "Transparency and explainability. The CDSE shall provide, alongside each recommendation, a human-readable explanation of the reasoning applied — including the rules evaluated, the data inputs considered, and the evidence or guideline source referenced — enabling clinicians to understand, evaluate, and exercise informed judgement about the guidance they receive."
msgstr ""

#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/t-c-business-services-components-benefits-package-registry-ad83df.md:7
msgid "Transparent, understandable, and accessible information about what they are entitled to, enabling informed engagement with services and accountability for what is delivered."
msgstr ""

#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/t-c-metadata-registries-and-foundati-logical-information-model-reposi-257cac.md:11
msgid "TS change notification handling. The LIMR shall subscribe to change notifications from the Terminology Service and shall initiate impact analysis workflows when value sets or code systems that are referenced by LIMR models are updated, deprecated, or retired, ensuring that affected models are reviewed and updated in coordination with terminology changes."
msgstr ""

#: folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/p-c-business-services-components-benefits-package-registry-c8dd7e.md:2
msgid "Two adjacent operational components are architecturally distinct from the registry and should not be conflated with it."
