msgid "Value set management. Definition, storage, and publication of value sets using both intensional (rule-based selection of concepts from a code system) and extensional (explicitly enumerated list of codes) definitions, with full versioning and lifecycle states, enabling consuming systems to retrieve the exact set of permitted values for a given data element at any given point in time."
